#
# SELECTION NOTES (provenance exceptions, recorded up front):
# - Chart-25-o: only patch2 exists (patch2-Chart-25-Arja-plausible.patch);
#   the one deviation from the patch1 preference.
# - Closure-18-o (SequenceR) and Math-50-o (HDRepair): probe FALSE-ZERO
